Spring Boot MVC - Internationalization (i18n)
Practice Tasks
TASK 1: Employee Welcome Page (Internationalization)
Scenario
Create a Spring Boot MVC application that displays employee details. The page should
support English and Hindi languages using Spring Message Resource Bundles.
Requirements
1. Create EmployeeController
Request Mapping: GET /employee
Add Model Data:
Employee Name : Rahul Sharma
Department : IT
Return: employee.jsp
2. Create employee.jsp
Display labels using Spring Message:
Employee Details
Employee Name
Department
Welcome
Display model values.
Example Output:
Employee Details
Employee Name : Rahul Sharma
Department : IT
Welcome to Spring Boot MVC
3. Create Message Files
messages.properties
title=Employee Details
name=Employee Name
department=Department
welcome=Welcome to Spring Boot MVC
messages_hi.properties
title= 
name=  
department=
welcome=  MVC    
Expected URLs:
http://localhost:8080/employee?lang=en
http://localhost:8080/employee?lang=hi